      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "seems to be related:\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1342-animating-vrc-phyboneallow-grabbing-no-longer-works\n\n^ This is the reason why Nr. 1 doesn't work correctly. This can be fixed if you modify the animations that marshmallow_PB uses.\n\n(I completely removed that grabbing anyways, so I just removed all the *.allowCollision animation properties)\n\nPS: with a bit of work, you can integrate the whole marshmallow animation setup in to one blendtree ;)",
